<title>USA: DTE Energy Co Q3 net, revenues lower.</title>
<headline>DTE Energy Co Q3 net, revenues lower.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					September 30		Percent</p>
<p>					   1996	   1995     Change</p>
<p> Operating Revenues	     $977,334   $1,032,289     (5.3)</p>
<p> Operating Income		  118,640	225,114    (47.3)</p>
<p> Net Income			   44,933	141,412    (68.2)</p>
<p> Avge Shares Outstanding   145,119,875  144,905,909	 0.1</p>
<p> Earnings Per Common Share	  0.31	   0.98    (68.4)</p>
<p>Note: 1996 Q3 net includes a steam heating special charge of $149.2 million ($97 million after-tax), or $0.67 a share.  </p>
<p>					    Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					September 30		Percent</p>
<p>					    1996	   1995    Change</p>
<p> Operating Revenues	    $2,758,234   $2,768,518    (0.4)</p>
<p> Operating Income		   459,650	584,992   (21.4)</p>
<p> Net Income			   231,626	331,647   (30.2)</p>
<p> Avge Shares Outstanding    145,119,875  144,882,040	0.2</p>
<p> Earnings Per Common Share	   1.60	   2.29   (30.1)</p>
<p>Note: 1996 nine months net includes a steam heating special charge of $149.2 million ($97 million after-tax), or $0.67 per share.  </p>
<p>					  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>					 September 30	     Percent</p>
<p>						1996	 1995    Change</p>
<p> Operating Revenues	     $3,625,260  $3,571,192	1.5</p>
<p> Operating Income		    613,980     752,938   (18.5)</p>
<p> Net Income			    305,893     419,614   (27.1)</p>
<p> Avge Shares Outstanding     144,727,881 144,876,686    (0.1)</p>
<p> Earnings Per Common Share	    2.11	  2.90   (27.2)</p>
<p>Note: 1996 12-month net includes a steam heating special charge of $149.2 million ($97 million after-tax), or $0.67 a share, and a write-off of steam heating plant assets of $42 million ($32 million after-tax), or $0.22 a share.</p>
<p>(Dollars in thousands except per share, average share amounts.)</p>
<p>	     Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
